1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:11,050
A field request, in Nigerian business English: twelve butterfly valves at a hundred and eighty-five thousand, forty gasket kits at twelve-five, fifty coveralls at eighteen thousand.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,850
Watch the trace.

3
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:20,025
Policy runs first — before the model — and puts this in lane two: consequential, human approval required.

4
00:00:20,025 --> 00:00:25,850
Then the real N-ATLAS call — about three and a half seconds on a rented RTX 3090.

5
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:28,337
The output isn't prose.

6
00:00:28,337 --> 00:00:36,762
It's a validated invoice draft — three million six hundred and twenty thousand naira, arithmetic checked deterministically, never by the model.

7
00:00:36,762 --> 00:00:43,325
Every field carries provenance: what came from the request, what the model inferred, what the system computed.

